## Operational checklist

- Measure cost per successful task before optimizing.
- Locate spend concentration by task class and model.
- Form one reversible optimization hypothesis.
- Evaluate the changed cohort against a baseline.
- Watch corrections and escalations after rollout.
- Standardize only savings that persist without quality loss.

